title: "Calibration Lab: Do small, quantized language models know what they know?"
abstract: "A pre-registered conceptual replication of Kadavath et al. (2022), measuring whether the confidence of small-scale, quantized Gemma 3 models separates their correct answers from their incorrect ones (AUROC), at sizes and precisions that run on consumer hardware."
